* A series of continuous functions with a summable majorant (M-test) may be integrated termwise along a segment: the partial sums converge uniformly (~ uhlim ), the limit is continuous (~ ulmcn ), and the segment integral of the remainder is below ` | B - A | ` times its uniform bound (~ ulm2 , ~ lintfsum , ~ lintlc , ~ lintabs ).

